url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":1263,"closed_issues":1,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-03-26T10:06:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:51Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-31T18:40:25Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T10:50:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv3.7.dev.custom_build [5155fe5a4]\n\nI don't know if this happens in Godot 4.\n\n\n### System information\n\nw10 64\n\n### Issue description\n\nI am modifying the volume of my music track, but Godot always displays the same waveform/amplitude graph.\n\nNote that in Audacity the amplitude is high as you can see in this screenshot, but Godot still shows the initial waveform from when the volume was much lower.\nConclusion: Godot does not update the amplitude graph of audio files when they are edited and automatically reimported by Godot.\n\nIn Audacity, the track volume has been increased:\n\n<img width=\"1405\" height=\"351\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f132eb3-5e48-4d9a-bc4c-86ac5f080a41\" />\n\nGodot still shows the previous amplitude, even though the track has already been reimported into Godot:\n\n<img width=\"328\" height=\"119\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/805c3a4a-ace8-4cf0-a34b-ca2b945e75f4\" />\n\nTo make Godot update the waveform graph, you need to reload the project.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate an audio track.\nImport it into Godot.\nEdit the track and increase (or decrease) its volume.\nExport the track.\nGodot will automatically reimport it, but it will not update the amplitude/waveform graph.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[testAudioGraphic.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21535915/testAudioGraphic.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109173/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}